! POWHEG-BOX-V2 / ggxy_ggZH: gg -> Z(l+l-) H at NLO QCD + PS, 13.6 TeV
! (arXiv:2603.15762; ggxy, CPC 320 (2026) 109933).  Physics settings of the authors' testrun
! card: mu_R = mu_F = m_ZH/2 (process default), on-shell m_t = 172.5 GeV, extZ 1, hdamp 250;
! Z -> l+l- (l = e, mu, tau; vdecaymode 11) with 15 < m_ll < 150 GeV (the two-loop amplitudes
! are expanded in the external masses: m_ll and m_H must stay below 150 GeV); on-shell,
! undecayed Higgs; NNPDF3.1 NNLO (LHAPDF 325300).  Integration settings as in the CMS gridpack.
! The run scripts append the run-control lines (numevts, iseed, manyseeds, parallelstage,
! xgriditeration, bornonly, scale factors, reweighting list).
Zmass 91.1876
Zwidth 2.4955
Hmass 125.0
topmass 172.5
Wmass 80.385
min_z_mass     15d0
max_z_mass    150d0
onshellhiggs 1
Hwidth 4.07d-3
min_h_mass    15d0
max_h_mass   150d0
vdecaymode  11
hdecaymode -1
chzz      1.0
extZ 1
mtscheme          0
mtscale           1
mutscfact         1d0
crd_runLoops_as   5
crd_runLoops_mt   5
crd_convLoops_mt  4
crd_as5mz         0.118d0
crd_mz            91.1876d0
ih1         1
ih2         1
ebeam1 6800d0
ebeam2 6800d0
lhans1 325300
lhans2 325300
use-old-grid    1
use-old-ubound  1
ncall1  20000
itmx1       3
ncall2  40000
itmx2       2
foldcsi     1
foldy       1
foldphi     1
nubound 20000
facscfact   1d0
renscfact   1d0
alphas_from_pdf 1
LOevents          0
bornonly          0
fastbtlbound      1
storemintupb      1
ubexcess_correct  1
withnegweights    1
hdamp           250
check_bad_st1 1
check_bad_st2 1
